@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@calculationId = 1

### Preview an unsaved inquiry with supplier, customer and active calculation rows
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inquiries/from-calculation/{{calculationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown calculation returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inquiries/from-calculation/2147483647
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save a draft: use IDs and edited values from the preview response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inquiries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": 1,
  "calculationId": {{calculationId}},
  "customerId": 1,
  "selectedSupplierId": 1,
  "selectedRecipientYourRef": "Supplier contact",
  "selectedRecipientTermsOfDelivery": "DAP",
  "selectedRecipientTermsOfPayment": "30 days",
  "selectedRecipientLanguageId": 1,
  "calculationRowIds": [1]
}
